  vendorName: Mayor Mortimer
  offerText: The city needs 'donations' for the new plaza. Hand over a hefty envelope
    of cash now, and I will ensure the administration remembers your loyalty.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the heavy envelope. You feel quite proud and secure
    in your social standing.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the mayor. You spend the hour nervously checking your
    locks, fearing his retaliation.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Mortimer is arrested for massive fraud! For refusing his schemes,
    the new city council grants you a very generous tax rebate.
